//RS /// (`slot.as_ref().expect("MIR value")`) is never taken, written through or
//RS /// re-initialized, so it becomes `let slot: T = E;`: an owned read names a
//RS /// Copy scalar directly and clones any other type, and a borrow is `&slot`.
