//RS /// `'cK`), and leading indentation becomes one space per four-space level,
//RS /// capped at eight. String, raw-string and comment text is never touched,
//RS /// and a line that starts inside a string keeps its indentation. The names
//RS /// are local to the function, so the renaming is consistent by construction.
