//RS /// Emits a folded aggregate constant as one per-thread value built once, at
//RS /// its first read. `NAME_shared()` hands a read that value itself (a
//RS /// `JetSharedSlot`, which readers borrow in place), and only the owned
//RS /// accessor `NAME()` copies it.
